{"scene_id": "s01027", "source": "/home/user/screenwrite-analyzers/data/analyzers/gen/scenes/s01027.fountain", "heading": "INT. STARLITE ROLLER RINK - SIX A.M.", "cast": [{"id": 0, "name": "DEZI ALVARADO", "names": ["DEZI ALVARADO", "DEZI"], "gender": "?", "first": 4, "spoke": 12}, {"id": 1, "name": "BOY", "names": ["BOY"], "gender": "m", "first": 8, "spoke": 6}, {"id": 2, "name": "JUNIOR", "names": ["JUNIOR"], "gender": "?", "first": 24, "spoke": 7}, {"id": 3, "name": "FAIRWEATHER", "names": ["FAIRWEATHER", "MS. FAIRWEATHER"], "gender": "?", "first": 51, "spoke": 4}], "units": [{"u": 0, "kind": "heading", "text": "INT. STARLITE ROLLER RINK - SIX A.M.", "present": []}, {"u": 1, "kind": "action", "text": "Carpet-walled, smelling of floor wax and old nacho cheese.", "para": 0, "sent": 0, "present": []}, {"u": 2, "kind": "action", "text": "A disco ball turns without light, a silent planet.", "para": 0, "sent": 1, "present": []}, {"u": 3, "kind": "action", "text": "The maple floor is empty and gleaming like a frozen lake.", "para": 0, "sent": 2, "present": []}, {"u": 4, "kind": "action", "text": "DEZI ALVARADO, 15, sits on the bench in secondhand skates, laces undone.", "para": 1, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 5, "kind": "action", "text": "Hoodie sleeves swallow her hands.", "para": 1, "sent": 1, "present": [0]}, {"u": 6, "kind": "action", "text": "She has been crying and has recently stopped.", "para": 1, "sent": 2, "present": [0]}, {"u": 7, "kind": "action", "text": "A figure leans against the snack counter.", "para": 2, "sent": 0, "present": [0]}, {"u": 8, "kind": "action", "text": "A BOY in a faded letterman jacket, tall, thin as a coat rack, a toothpick rolling in his mouth.", "para": 2, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 9, "kind": "action", "text": "He watches her without moving.", "para": 2, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 10, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "You've got two left feet.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 11, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I've got one left foot and one broken heart.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 12, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Which is worse?", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 13, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Depends who you ask.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 14, "kind": "action", "text": "She stands, wobbles, grabs the rail.", "para": 3, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 15, "kind": "action", "text": "He doesn't help.", "para": 3, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 16, "kind": "action", "text": "A kindness, of a kind.", "para": 3, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 17, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "They're saying you took your mother's car.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 18, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Borrowed.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 19, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Without asking.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 20, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "She was asleep.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 21, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dezi.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 22, "kind": "action", "text": "She looks at him sharply.", "para": 4, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 23, "kind": "action", "text": "He shrugs, almost apologetic.", "para": 4, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1]}, {"u": 24, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "My name's Junior, by the way. Since you're not going to ask.", "name": "BOY", "speaker": 1, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 25, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Everyone calls me Junior. My dad's Junior too. Nobody knows who the first one was.", "name": "JUNIOR", "speaker": 2, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 26, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's the saddest thing I've heard all week.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 27, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It's been a long week?", "name": "JUNIOR", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 28, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Rough.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 29, "kind": "action", "text": "She pushes off the rail.", "para": 5, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 30, "kind": "action", "text": "Rolls two feet.", "para": 5, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 31, "kind": "action", "text": "Wavers.", "para": 5, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 32, "kind": "action", "text": "Falls.", "para": 5, "sent": 3, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 33, "kind": "action", "text": "Hard.", "para": 5, "sent": 4, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 34, "kind": "action", "text": "Sits on the floor with her palms flat.", "para": 5, "sent": 5, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 35, "kind": "action", "text": "For a moment, she isn't sure if she's going to scream or laugh.", "para": 6, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 36, "kind": "action", "text": "She does both.", "para": 7, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 37, "kind": "action", "text": "The sound ricochets off the carpeted walls.", "para": 8, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 38, "kind": "action", "text": "Junior flinches, then, slowly, grins.", "para": 8, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 39, "kind": "action", "text": "He steps onto the floor in his sneakers and slides to her.", "para": 8, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 40, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "That's it. Get it out.", "name": "JUNIOR", "speaker": 2, "ext": ["CONT'D"], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 41, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I hate everyone.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 42, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Me too.", "name": "JUNIOR", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 43, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I hate my mother.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 44, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Mine's all right. But I hate my dad.", "name": "JUNIOR", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 45, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "I don't hate her. I just wanted to drive somewhere nobody knew.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 46, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "And you ended up at a roller rink.", "name": "JUNIOR", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 47, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "It was the only thing open.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 48, "kind": "action", "text": "The lights come on.", "para": 9, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 49, "kind": "action", "text": "All at once, bright as an operating room.", "para": 9, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 50, "kind": "action", "text": "The disco ball catches a beam and sprays confetti across the walls.", "para": 9, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2]}, {"u": 51, "kind": "action", "text": "MS. FAIRWEATHER, 60s, rink manager, a cardigan embroidered with tiny skates, comes through the swinging doors with a ring of keys and a coffee thermos.", "para": 10, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 52, "kind": "action", "text": "She stops dead.", "para": 10, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 53, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "We don't open for four hours.", "name": "MS. FAIRWEATHER", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 54, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Morning, Ms. Fairweather.", "name": "JUNIOR", "speaker": 2, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 55, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Junior. You are not supposed to be here. Neither is she. Whoever she is.", "name": "MS. FAIRWEATHER", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 56, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dezi.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 57, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Dezi. Well. Are you hurt?", "name": "MS. FAIRWEATHER", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 58, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "No.", "name": "DEZI", "speaker": 0, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 59, "kind": "dialogue", "text": "Good. Skates off. Both of you. There's a pot of coffee in the back and a patched-up phone. Call your mother.", "name": "MS. FAIRWEATHER", "speaker": 3, "ext": [], "paren": [], "dual": false, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 60, "kind": "action", "text": "Dezi looks at Junior.", "para": 11, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 61, "kind": "action", "text": "He lifts one shoulder.", "para": 11, "sent": 1, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 62, "kind": "action", "text": "Almost a smile.", "para": 11, "sent": 2, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}, {"u": 63, "kind": "action", "text": "She begins to unlace.", "para": 12, "sent": 0, "present": [0, 1, 2, 3]}]}